@title Gunstar Super Heroes (USA)
@file Gunstar Super Heroes (U).gba
@game BHGE
@chip EEPROM
@save skip: nothing is written before a stage is cleared (checked: GAME START > RED > NORMAL > NEW DATA up to stage select, and changing OPTIONS, both leave a blank EEPROM); the first save is after clearing Earth / Sky Port, whose ship interior (fiery-blended sprites, no score for minutes of shooting) could not be finished in budget
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# Red, Normal, New Data, Earth stage: shoot through the soldiers, kill the
# big grunt mini-boss (score 3000), go left into the ship's hall and fight.
# Session notes: title/menus have animated backgrounds out of phase on all
# three (compare=text). In the stage nba draws shot sparks and enemy
# positions slightly differently (f2706, f3546, f3706). In the ship hall
# (f5122 onward) nba shows thin white horizontal lines across the
# background at about scanlines 50 and 90 and draws the centre pillar
# without its perspective taper (f6096), where dingbat-bios and mgba agree.

